    "description": "As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a>, you and any allies affected by your <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Battle_Meditation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Battle Meditation\">Battle Meditation</a></b> gain a +2 insight bonus to their <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a>, lasting as long as they are affected by your <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Battle_Meditation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Battle Meditation\">Battle Meditation</a></b>. Additionally, you gain a +1 bonus to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> checks to <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Block\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Block\">Block</a></b> and <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deflect\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deflect\">Deflect</a></b> (as per the Talents) for each adjacent ally wielding a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a>.",
